<title>NORWAY: N. Sea Statfjord, Gullfaks oil loadings normal.</title>
<headline>N. Sea Statfjord, Gullfaks oil loadings normal.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>All offshore crude loadings and production at the North Sea Statfjord and Gullfaks developments were normal on Thursday, operator Den norske stats oljeselskap AS (Statoil) said.</p>
<p>&quot;There is one tanker loading at Statfjord and the weather is fine. The forecast for the next 48 hours is very good,&quot; a Statoil spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Oil loadings into shuttle tankers at the offshore buoys are often disrupted during winter due to high winds and swell.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
